<title>UK: Brent cargo trades at strong Aug +15 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades at strong Aug +15 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of August-loading Brent crude oil traded on Wednesday at a differential five cents above a deal on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load in the August 4-6 range, was bought by a refiner at August Brent +15 cents.</p>
<p>On Tuesday two Brent cargoes sold at August Brent +10 cents, up from Monday's August Brent +5 cents deal.</p>
<p>--Siobhan Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
